Beginning at a concrete monument No. 1, located at the head of Alapai Street, from which monument the azimuth (measured clockwise from the true south) and distance to Territory survey street monument "A" located on the corner of Alapai and Prospect Streets is 46° 37' 30", 329.55 feet; from said monument "A" the azimuth and distance to "Punchbowl" triangulation station is 183° 41' 03", 1,193.65 feet, thence by true azimuths and distances, as follows:

